<title>USA: Hussey raises copper price one cent to $1.09.</title>
<headline>Hussey raises copper price one cent to $1.09.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hussey Copper Ltd said it</p>
<p>raised its contained copper price one cent to 109 cents a lb, effective from October 10 shipments.</p>
<p>--New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1640</p>
</text>
